# Store all text with LF in the repository, whatever the contributor's OS uses.
# Without this, Windows checkouts can commit CRLF and a one-line edit shows up
# as a whole-file diff (main/db_mavlink_msgs.c: 18 real lines, 892 reported).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending-convert binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
